# envelopes
===
 Envelopes is a self-hosted budgeting platform inspired by Dave Ramsey's envelope method. Manage cash-style budgets, track spending, and tackle debt with Snowball and Avalanche planners. Available as a server app with browser access, Windows (.exe), Linux (.deb), and Android (APK) clients.
